            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/users/me",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "users",
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Expected: **200**. Customer: `name`, `contactNumber`, `address`, `areaId`, `meterNumber`. Technician: `name`, `contactNumber`, `isAvailable` (on / off duty).\n\nTo set a profile photo, send `multipart/form-data` instead of JSON: the image in `profilePhoto` (JPEG, PNG or WebP, up to 5 MB) and, optionally, the other fields as JSON in a text field named `data`. The image is stored on Cloudinary and the previous one is removed.\n\nOther outcomes:\n- **400** Not an image (multipart)\n- **400** Nothing to update"
          },
          "response": []
        },
