          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{adminToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"customerId\": \"{{customerId}}\",\n  \"billingMonth\": \"{{thisMonth}}\",\n  \"currentReading\": 6105\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/bills",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "bills"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Expected: **201**. Units = `currentReading` − the customer's last reading. Residential connections use the slab tariff (each slice of units at its own slab's rate), commercial ones a flat rate; then a demand charge per kW and 5% VAT. Calculated in integer paisa. One bill per customer per month. The customer is emailed the bill. `customerId` is saved by *Get my profile*; `{{thisMonth}}` by the pre-request script. Saves `billId`.\n\nOther outcomes:\n- **409** Month already billed\n- **400** Validation failed\n- **404** Customer not found"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "List bills",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{customerToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/bills?sortBy=billingMonth&sortOrder=desc",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "bills"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "sortBy",
                  "value": "billingMonth"
                },
                {
                  "key": "sortOrder",
                  "value": "desc"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Expected: **200**. Customer: their own bills. Admin: all, filtered by `status`, `billingMonth`, `customerId`, `overdue`. Every bill carries its payment attempts (this is how a payment's status is tracked) and a computed `isOverdue`.\n\nOther outcomes:\n- **403** Technician is not allowed"
          },
          "response": []
        }
