    {
      "name": "Payments",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Initiate a bKash payment (customer)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.data && body.data.paymentId) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"paymentId\", body.data.paymentId);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"bkashPaymentId\", body.data.bkashPaymentId);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{customerToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"billId\": \"{{billId}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/payments/initiate",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "payments",
                "initiate"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Expected: **201**. For the customer's own UNPAID bill. Older pending attempts for the bill are expired, a PENDING payment is created, and bKash returns the checkout page as `paymentUrl`. Open it in a browser and pay with the sandbox wallet `01770618575`, OTP `123456`, PIN `12121`; bKash then redirects to the callback. Limited to 5 attempts a minute per customer. Saves `paymentId` and `bkashPaymentId`.\n\nOther outcomes:\n- **404** Not this customer's bill\n- **409** Bill already paid"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "bKash callback (public)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/payments/bkash/callback?paymentID={{bkashPaymentId}}&status=success",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "payments",
                "bkash",
                "callback"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "paymentID",
                  "value": "{{bkashPaymentId}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "status",
                  "value": "success"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Expected: **200**. bKash redirects the customer's browser here, so there is no token. `status=success` is never trusted on its own: the server executes the payment with bKash (falling back to a status query) and settles only when bKash reports code `0000`, `Completed` and the billed amount. Payment PENDING → PAID and bill UNPAID → PAID are conditional updates in one transaction, so opening the same URL again changes nothing. The customer is emailed a receipt once.\n\nOther outcomes:\n- **404** Unknown payment\n- **400** Invalid query"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "bKash tokenized checkout under `/api/v1/payments`: initiation and the verified, idempotent callback."
    },
